{
  "id": 181713898,
  "iid": 8436,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "RTP Player: Fix: Only silence played on Windows with Qt 6.x",
  "description": "Qt 6.x has different timing of events during audio play than Qt 5.x on\nWin32 or Qt6.x on Linux/Mac. It caused race condition which removed\nstream from playback queue sooner it was really played.\nIt was random (some audio streams triggered it, some didn't).\n\nCloses #18413",
